# The compiled tree the open-build tests stage, and the package the packaging
# test packs from it: one per test process, made with `mkdtemp` under this
# package so the entry points still resolve `@perbo/*` and read
# `../package.json`, and removed when the run ends. Never `dist/`, which is
# shared, can be stale, and is being read by the suites running alongside
# (apps/cli/src/test-support/open-build.ts, apps/cli/test/packaging.test.ts).
.test-dist-*/
